{"author":{"id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMzkyODI5","is_bot":false,"login":"TaoSama","name":"Wentao Lu"},"baseRefName":"main","body":"## Summary\n- Reconcile Internet camera permission state on foreground resume when a recovery panel is visible, so a manual Camera grant outside Vibe Screen launches the QR scanner once.\n- Keep Internet foreground startup out of USB auto-reconnect scheduling while moving camera recovery to onResume.\n- Add policy/contract/instrumentation coverage plus retained Nubia P0110 no-Host evidence with rebuilt SHA256SUMS.\n\n## Verification\n- ./gradlew --no-daemon --console=plain :app:testDebugUnitTest --tests dev.telemachus.display.InternetCameraPermissionRecoveryPolicyTest --tests dev.telemachus.display.MainActivityTerminalGuidanceContractTest --tests dev.telemachus.display.CameraPermissionResumePolicyTest\n- ./gradlew --no-daemon --console=plain :app:compileDebugAndroidTestKotlin :app:lintDebug\n- make baseline-android-check\n- python3 -m unittest tests.phase3.test_repository_privacy\n- make phase3-test\n- ANDROID_SERIAL=<redacted-adb-serial> ./gradlew --no-daemon --console=plain :app:connectedDebugAndroidTest -Pandroid.testInstrumentationRunnerArguments.class=dev.telemachus.display.InternetCameraPermissionRecoveryInstrumentedTest#visibleInternetPermissionPanelGrantedOutsideAppLaunchesScannerOnForegroundReturn -Pandroid.testInstrumentationRunnerArguments.vibeScreenInternetCameraRecovery=true\n- cd docs/changes/2026-08-22-android-ui-ux-audit/evidence/2026-09-15-nubia-p0110-internet-camera-manual-settings-return-after-798 && shasum -a 256 -c SHA256SUMS\n\n## Cleanup verified\n- dev.telemachus.display not installed on the P0110 after the final device run\n- CAMERA appops reports No UID for dev.telemachus.display\n- adb reverse --list is empty\n- lsof -nP -iTCP:54321 -sTCP:LISTEN returns no listener\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **Bug Fixes**\n  * Improved camera-permission recovery when returning from Android settings.\n  * The QR scanner now launches once permission is granted externally, and the preview becomes available.\n  * Prevented unintended USB reconnect behavior while disconnected in Internet mode.\n\n* **Tests**\n  * Added automated coverage for permission recovery and foreground return behavior.\n\n* **Documentation**\n  * Added verification records confirming successful camera recovery and scanner launch on Android.\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->","closedAt":"2026-09-15T19:00:51Z","files":[{"path":"baseline/AndroidClient/app/src/androidTest/java/dev/telemachus/display/InternetCameraPermissionRecoveryInstrumentedTest.kt","additions":199,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"baseline/AndroidClient/app/src/main/java/dev/telemachus/display/InternetCameraPermissionRecoveryPolicy.kt","additions":15,"deletions":4,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"baseline/AndroidClient/app/src/main/java/dev/telemachus/display/MainActivity.kt","additions":47,"deletions":11,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"baseline/AndroidClient/app/src/test/java/dev/telemachus/display/InternetCameraPermissionRecoveryPolicyTest.kt","additions":44,"deletions":14,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"baseline/AndroidClient/app/src/test/java/dev/telemachus/display/MainActivityTerminalGuidanceContractTest.kt","additions":45,"deletions":8,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"docs/changes/2026-08-22-android-ui-ux-audit/evidence/2026-09-15-nubia-p0110-internet-camera-manual-settings-return-after-798/README.md","additions":39,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"docs/changes/2026-08-22-android-ui-ux-audit/evidence/2026-09-15-nubia-p0110-internet-camera-manual-settings-return-after-798/SHA256SUMS","additions":55,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"docs/changes/2026-08-22-android-ui-ux-audit/evidence/2026-09-15-nubia-p0110-internet-camera-manual-settings-return-after-798/commands.txt","additions":33,"deletions":0,"chan